{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-03",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "蓝海路线与改版  (Blue-Ocean Strategy and Overhaul)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Back in the chief editor's office, Kaiwen and Xingzi explain to Bu Xiaogu why Chun Yuqiao will want a bold overhaul of Twelve Singers—and why nobody dares tell him the pitch meeting date. Listen to their conversation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "新一季的方案都差不多了，现在还有一大问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "问题在于老大的心思，可能是要完全改版。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他这人特立独行，喜欢走蓝海路线。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "最讨厌的就是像现在这种同质化竞争。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "改版的事都想了两季了，今年估计肯定得干了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "可是老大从医院出来一切推翻重来，时间可就太紧了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且他会连夜加班干呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也可以加班。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "主要是改版这种事，一向都是受质疑的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "前期的铺垫沟通不到位，上了会还是得被毙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我们就提前告诉淳于总这个方案会的时间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你信不信他从医院里立刻拔了管就赶过来？不能告诉他！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "新一季的方案都差不多了，现在还有一大问题。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The proposal for the new season is nearly ready, yet one huge problem remains.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "问题在于老大的心思，可能是要完全改版。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The issue is that in the boss's mind, he probably wants a complete format overhaul.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他这人特立独行，喜欢走蓝海路线。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He is fiercely independent and likes charting a blue-ocean course.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "最讨厌的就是像现在这种同质化竞争。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What he hates most is the kind of copycat competition happening right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "改版的事都想了两季了，今年估计肯定得干了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He has mulled over a revamp for two seasons now, and this year he will surely do it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "可是老大从医院出来一切推翻重来，时间可就太紧了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet if the boss leaves hospital and scraps everything to start over, time will be way too tight.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且他会连夜加班干呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And he would work through the night nonstop.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也可以加班。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I can work overtime too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "主要是改版这种事，一向都是受质疑的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The main thing is that a major revamp always faces heavy skepticism.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "前期的铺垫沟通不到位，上了会还是得被毙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Without proper groundwork and communication beforehand, it will get shot down at the meeting.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我们就提前告诉淳于总这个方案会的时间。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then let us tell Mr Chun Yuqiao the date of this pitch meeting in advance.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你信不信他从医院里立刻拔了管就赶过来？不能告诉他！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Believe me, he would pull out his IV tube and rush straight here from hospital—we must not tell him!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "新一季的方案都差不多了，现在还有一大问题。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "问题在于老大的心思，可能是要完全改版。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "他这人特立独行，喜欢走蓝海路线。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "最讨厌的就是像现在这种同质化竞争。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "改版的事都想了两季了，今年估计肯定得干了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "可是老大从医院出来一切推翻重来，时间可就太紧了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "而且他会连夜加班干呢。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也可以加班。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "主要是改版这种事，一向都是受质疑的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "前期的铺垫沟通不到位，上了会还是得被毙。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "那我们就提前告诉淳于总这个方案会的时间。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "你信不信他从医院里立刻拔了管就赶过来？不能告诉他！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Determined to let Chun Yuqiao recover in peace, the trio decides to shoulder the pitch preparation on their own. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
